commit 4f4c0ed4f33462ca692e6455c47551e34966c366
Author: Daniel Rosemann <daniel.rosemann10@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Oct 23 18:48:11 2026 +0200

    refactor: split game.js monolith into sim/render/input/ui modules (issue #8)
    
    Simulation (src/simulation), rendering incl. 2.5D foundation (src/rendering), input, UI, audio, data and persistence now live in src/ with game.html loading src/main.js. Balancing values and save formats unchanged.
    
    Co-authored-by: Muse Code <muse-code@meta.com>

