commit 31f4202c60ad2ba550a3bd908c78e8fe93b87ffa
Author: Daniel Rosemann <daniel.rosemann10@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Oct 22 22:49:24 2026 +0200

    feat: implement stranded-horizons v2 one-world foundation
    
    Server-authoritative factory game: Express + Socket.IO server, Postgres schema, shared world/economy logic, v2 client slice, admin map, MC importer, self-hosted deploy docs. Vercel-compatible, v1 untouched.
    
    Co-authored-by: Muse Spark <muse-spark@meta.com>

